---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { supportEmail } from '../config/site';

const lastUpdated = 'June 6, 2025';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — Pixel Arc Labs"
  description="Privacy Policy for Pixel Arc Labs and the mobile applications we publish."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <header>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-wide text-accent uppercase">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose-custom mt-12 space-y-10 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Who we are</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Pixel Arc Labs ("we," "us," or "our") develops and publishes mobile applications
          for iOS. This Privacy Policy describes how we collect, use, and protect
          information when you use our apps or visit our website at pixelarclabs.com.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          If you have questions about this policy, contact us at{' '}
          <a
            href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}
            class="text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-hover focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent rounded-sm"
          >
            {supportEmail}
          </a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Information we collect</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          The information we collect depends on which Pixel Arc Labs app you use and how
          you interact with it. In general, our apps may collect:
        </p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text">Account information</strong> — such as your email
            address or name, if you create an account or sign in.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text">App data</strong> — information you enter or
            generate while using an app (for example, preferences, content, or records
            you create).
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text">Device information</strong> — such as device model,
            operating system version, and app version, used to provide support and improve
            compatibility.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong class="text-text">Usage information</strong> — such as feature usage
            and crash reports, to help us fix bugs and improve performance.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We do not sell your personal information. Specific apps may collect additional
          data as described in their in-app notices or settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">How we use your information</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">We use collected information to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Provide, maintain, and improve our apps and services</li>
          <li>Authenticate your account and sync your data across devices</li>
          <li>Respond to support requests and communicate with you</li>
          <li>Diagnose technical issues and prevent fraud or abuse</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">How we store and protect data</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We take reasonable measures to protect your information using industry-standard
          security practices. Data may be stored on your device, on our servers, or with
          trusted service providers that help us operate our apps.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We retain information only as long as needed to provide our services, comply
          with legal requirements, or resolve disputes. You may request deletion of your
          account and associated data by contacting us.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Third-party services</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Some Pixel Arc Labs apps may integrate with third-party services — such as cloud
          hosting, authentication, analytics, or payment providers — to deliver core
          functionality. These services process data according to their own privacy
          policies.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We choose providers carefully and limit the data shared to what is necessary for
          the service to function. Details about third-party integrations for a specific
          app may be available in that app's settings or documentation.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Your rights and choices</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">Depending on where you live, you may have the right to:</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6">
          <li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction or deletion of your data</li>
          <li>Object to or restrict certain processing</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">
          To exercise these rights, email us at{' '}
          <a
            href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}
            class="text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-hover focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent rounded-sm"
          >
            {supportEmail}
          </a>. We will respond within a reasonable timeframe.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Children's privacy</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Our apps are not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
          personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with
          personal information, please contact us and we will delete it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. When we do, we will revise
          the "Last updated" date at the top of this page. Continued use of our apps after
          changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Pixel Arc Labs<br />
          Email:{' '}
          <a
            href={`mailto:${supportEmail}`}
            class="text-accent transition-colors hover:text-accent-hover focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent rounded-sm"
          >
            {supportEmail}
          </a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-16">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="text-sm text-text-muted transition-colors hover:text-accent focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent rounded-sm"
      >
        &larr; Back to home
      </a>
    </p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
